<title>POLAND: Polfa Kutno trades on kerb at PLN 59.5.</title>
<headline>Polfa Kutno trades on kerb at PLN 59.5.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 21,180 shares in Polfa Kutno SA at 59.5 zlotys was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Wednesday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session, Polfa Kutno fell 1.4 percent to 68.5 zlotys in 10,366 share volume.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
